  <text xml:lang="grc"><body xml:base="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0019.polyidos.dindorf1893-grc1"><div type="edition" n="urn:cts:greekLit:tlg0019.polyidos.dindorf1893-grc1" xml:lang="grc" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_polyidos"><head>ΠΟΛΥΙΔΟΣ</head><div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="1" xml:id="fragment-polyidos-dindorf1893_grc1-1" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_polyidos">
            <note type="source">(1.) Stobæus LXVIII, 17. vol. III, p. 25</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἰδοὺ δίδωμι τήνδ᾽ ἐγὼ γυναῖκά σοι</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">Φαίδραν· ἐπὶ πῦρ δὲ πῦρ ἔοιχ᾽ ἤξειν ἄγων.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="2" xml:id="fragment-polyidos-dindorf1893_grc1-2" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_polyidos">
            <note type="source">(2.) Stobæus CXVIII, 16. vol. III, p. 451.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Τὸ γὰρ φοβεῖσθαι τὸν θάνατον λῆρος πολύς·</l>
              <l n="2" xml:lang="grc">πᾶσιν γὰρ ἡμῖν τοῦτ᾽ ὀφείλεται παθεῖν.</l>
            </lg>
            <note type="commentary">Alterum versum, nisi quid apud Stobæum turbatum est, sumpsit ab Sophocle, cujus ea sunt verba in Electra v. 1173.</note>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="3" xml:id="fragment-polyidos-dindorf1893_grc1-3" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_polyidos">
            <note type="source">(3.) Suidas in ἀνάριστος</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Τρέχω διὰ τῆς ἀγορᾶς ἀναρίστητος ὤν.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="4" xml:id="fragment-polyidos-dindorf1893_grc1-4" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_polyidos">
            <note type="source">(4.) Pollux IX, 31.</note>
            <lg type="fragment">
              <l n="1" xml:lang="grc">Ἐλλιμενίζεις ἢ δεκατεύεις.</l>
            </lg>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="5" xml:id="fragment-polyidos-dindorf1893_grc1-5" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_polyidos">
            <note type="source">(5.) Photius p. 13, 19. Suidas, Etymolog. M. p. 373, 19. et Michael Apostolius IX, 9, p. 105.</note>
            <quote>Ἔρημον ἐμβλέπειν: ἀκίνητον καὶ νωθρόν. οἷον ὅταν εἰς ἐρημίαν ἢ πέλαγος μέγα καὶ ἀχανὲς βλέπωμεν. Ἀριστοφάνης Πολυΐδῳ.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="6" xml:id="fragment-polyidos-dindorf1893_grc1-6" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_polyidos">
            <note type="source">(6.) Etymolog. M. p. 451, 51.</note>
            <quote>Θησειότριψ: ὁ ἐν τῷ Θησείῳ διατρίψας. Ἀριστοφάνης Πολυΐδῳ. καὶ θησομύζειν δὲ ἐν τῷ αὐτῷ λέγεται.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="7" xml:id="fragment-polyidos-dindorf1893_grc1-7" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_polyidos">
            <note type="source">(7.) Mæris p. 286.</note>
            <quote>Οὐκ ἀπήρκει: ἀντὶ τοῦ οὐκ ἀπέχρη. Ἀριστοφάνης Πολυείδῳ.</quote>
          </div>
          <div type="textpart" subtype="fragment" n="8" xml:id="fragment-polyidos-dindorf1893_grc1-8" corresp="urn:cite2:perseus:fragmentaryplays.v1:tlg0019_polyidos">
            <note type="source">(8.) Pollux IX, 130.</note>
            <quote>Ἀριστοφάνης δὲ ἐν Πολυείδῳ καὶ προσεμφερὴς εἶπε.</quote>
          </div>
        </div></body></text></TEI>
